  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon avocado oil",
    "1/2 medium yellow onion",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic",
    "2 teaspoon cumin",
    "1 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "3 ounce celery",
    "16 ounce ground lamb",
    "1/2 medium red bell pepper",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "300 gram cauliflower rice",
    "1 tablespoon avocado oil",
    "1/2 teaspoon dried basil",
    "1/2 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "1/2 medium lemon (juice and zest)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Keto-Spicy-Cumin-Lamb-Bowl-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a pan over medium heat, add avocado oil, garlic, and spices (cumin and chili flakes). Fry until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Keto-Spicy-Cumin-Lamb-Bowl-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the diced celery and continue frying for another 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Keto-Spicy-Cumin-Lamb-Bowl-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once celery is softened, add in the ground lamb and season with salt and pepper to taste. Use a spatula to break apart the lamb to mix in well with the vegetables.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Keto-Spicy-Cumin-Lamb-Bowl-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the lamb is browning, add in the bell pepper and continue cooking until bell pepper is soft. Remove from heat and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Keto-Spicy-Cumin-Lamb-Bowl-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate pan, add avocado oil over medium-high heat. Once hot, add in the cauliflower, basil, oregano, lemon zest, and salt and pepper to taste. Cook moisture out of the cauliflower, stirring frequently.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Keto-Spicy-Cumin-Lamb-Bowl-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cauliflower rice is done, plate in a bowl with the lamb and other vegetables, then squeeze lemon juice over the top. Garnish with lemon slices if desired. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spicy-cumin-lamb-bowl/#wprm-recipe-57109-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
